<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Hope this holiday season finds you well! </span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><br />We’re reaching out to share some changes to the Flywire Dashboard that will improve efficiencies and provide you with better visibility into your institution’s payment details. As part of these updates, you will notice the following enhancements over the coming weeks:</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Chargeback disputes</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">You can now view chargeback disputes directly within your Dashboard! Chargeback information appears in a new ‘Chargeback Disputes’ tab alongside ‘Payments’ and ‘Disbursements’ in the Incoming Payments module and shows:</span></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Chargeback disputes</span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Chargeback statuses</span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Deadline to submit defense documents</span></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Within the ‘Payments’ tab we have also added a blinking orange dot icon to highlight each payment that has a chargeback associated with it.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><br />In addition to now being able to see this information in the Dashboard, you will continue to receive emails from Flywire about chargeback details and any necessary action required.</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-1656-17" style="padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"><img border="0" valign="top" width="560" src="https://www.cdnrcad8t.com/kt2nizl59x/en_us/images/6578d4c77942b-1702417607.4967.png" alt="screenshot" title="" class="st-mobile-width-constraint" style="border: 0px; display: block; width: 560px; max-width: 100%;" /> </td> 
