<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">New and improved analytics (coming soon!)</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">In January we will be enhancing our Dashboard analytics capabilities to provide you with additional performance details as well as a new look and feel. Be on the lookout for more information next month!</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><br />We are excited about these Dashboard updates and will continue working to innovate to bring you and your team additional value. If you have any questions or would like to learn more about these enhancements, please reach out to your Relationship Manager or reply to this email. You can also access our <a style="color: #223341;" href="http://clientsupport.flywire.com?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Client Support Hub</u></strong></span></a> for payment inquiries, technical questions, or general support.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Happy Holidays,<br />Flywire Team</span></p> </td> 
